/*!
\page page_stl3eventsummary StL3EventSummary

\brief Summary of L3 online trigger decisions: event counters, algorithm results, z-vertex and unbiased flags.

\section stl3eventsummary_overview Overview
\c StL3EventSummary records the result of L3 online trigger processing for one event.
It stores run-segment counters (total processed, fully reconstructed), the online track
count, the unbiased pass-through flag and prescale, the z-vertex trigger flag, a copy
of the L0 trigger word, and two collections of \ref page_stl3algorithminfo objects:
all algorithms and those that accepted the event.

\section stl3eventsummary_hierarchy Class Hierarchy
\code
TObject
 └── StObject
      └── StL3EventSummary
\endcode

\section stl3eventsummary_members Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| Int_t | mNumberOfProcessedEvents | Events processed by L3 in this run segment |
| Int_t | mNumberOfReconstructedEvents | Events with full online reconstruction |
| UInt_t | mNumberOfTracks | Online tracks in this event |
| Int_t | mUnbiasedTriggerPreScale | Unbiased trigger prescale factor |
| Bool_t | mUnbiasedTrigger | Unbiased pass-through flag |
| Bool_t | mZVertexTrigger | z-vertex trigger flag |
| UInt_t | mL0TriggerWord | Copy of L0 trigger word |
| StSPtrVecL3AlgorithmInfo | mAlgorithms | All configured algorithm infos (owned) |
| StPtrVecL3AlgorithmInfo | mAlgorithmsAcceptingEvent | Algorithms that accepted this event |

\section stl3eventsummary_methods Key Methods

| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| `int numberOfProcessedEvents() const` | Total L3-processed events |
| `int numberOfReconstructedEvents() const` | Fully reconstructed events |
| `unsigned int numberOfTracks() const` | Online track count |
| `int numberOfAlgorithms() const` | Number of configured algorithms |
| `bool unbiasedTrigger() const` | Unbiased trigger flag |
| `bool zVertexTrigger() const` | z-vertex trigger flag |
| `unsigned int l0TriggerWord() const` | L0 trigger word copy |
| `StPtrVecL3AlgorithmInfo& algorithmsAcceptingEvent()` | Accepting algorithms |
| `StSPtrVecL3AlgorithmInfo& algorithms()` | All algorithms |

\section stl3eventsummary_usage Usage Example
\code{.cpp}
StL3EventSummary* sum = event->l3Trigger()->l3EventSummary();
cout << "z-vertex trigger: " << sum->zVertexTrigger() << endl;
for (const auto* alg : sum->algorithmsAcceptingEvent())
    cout << "  Alg " << alg->id() << " accepted" << endl;
\endcode

\see \ref page_stl3trigger
\see \ref page_stl3algorithminfo
*/
